<!-- Basketball staff lower third v2: a tinted-glass block, 700 x 132, centred at
     the bottom of a transparent 1920 x 1080 canvas (origin 610, 890), on the same
     baseline as the scorebug. Team logo panel on the left; the name panel (first
     and last name on one line) and the dark glass title strip stack to its right. For
     coaching staff, administrators and other non-players. Sibling draw order is
     front to back; within one shape the last paint declared is on top. -->
